--- a moment a statement loop borrows, handed to a function inside an
--- operator or into a variable, is copied as it is handed: compiled, the
--- borrow had been handed as it was, and the program did not build
--- (Rosetta Code, Palindrome dates)

fn year_of[t]
    return t.year

days = [moment[0], moment[1300000000], now[]]
for t in days
    log[year_of[t] gt 2000]
    y = year_of[t]
    log[y lt 1971]
